+Name
+
+    EXT_texture_storage
+
+Name Strings
+
+    GL_EXT_texture_storage
+
+Contact
+
+    Bruce Merry (bmerry 'at' gmail.com)
+    Ian Romanick, Intel (ian.d.romanick 'at' intel.com)
+
+Contributors
+
+    Jeremy Sandmel, Apple
